# Cursor/agent DISPATCH SCRATCH. These are one-shot task specs handed to `cursor-agent -p`,
# not repo content -- three of them reached main before anyone noticed (~20KB), and one landed
# via a PR whose actual deliverable was a docs page. Ignoring the pattern is the structural fix;
# deleting the three was only the cleanup.
